   A man from $retailChain.name comes forty-five minutes early for a ten o'clock, and she keeps him company on the couch.
   If she hosted the rooftop evening ($flags.retailIntro "sister"), it is the big man in the gray suit from that night,
   who had his hand on her back; otherwise a regional man she has never met. He watches her openly, and his hand goes
   from her knee to under the hem of her skirt, the other one to her waist, while she keeps up the small talk and lets
   her knees come apart. $ethan.name sees it from the coffee machine and looks away. The camera over the door. The limit
   is watched and handled: no sex (that is level 2 of the offer ladder). $darius.name comes to collect him at ten, and he
   is in no hurry. He never signed in, so she signs him in herself.
   Clips (images/characters/sister/tasks/, activity front_desk2): the two of them on the couch with coffee; his hand on
